    <sec id="intro">
      <title>Introduction</title>
      <p>A pull parser yields events in document order.</p>
      <p>Each item is forwarded as soon as its end tag is read.</p>
      <sec id="scope">
        <title>Scope</title>
        <p>Four dialects are in scope.</p>
      </sec>
    </sec>
